### Get all cats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats

### Get one cat
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/9592

### Add a cat
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cat_name": "Luna",
  "weight": 5,
  "owner": 3609,
  "filename": "luna.jpg",
  "birthdate": "2022-03-01"
}

### Update a cat
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/9592

### Delete a cat
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/9592

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users

### Get one user
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/3609

### Add a user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@metropolia.fi",
  "role": "user",
  "password": "secret"
}